      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Deception Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold, fire, lightning  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
      **Senses** truesight 120 ft., Passive Perception 17  
      **Languages** Abyssal; telepathy 120 ft.  
      **Challenge** 9 (5,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Traits

      ***Demonic Restoration.*** If the glabrezu dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** somewhere in the Abyss.

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The glabrezu has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The glabrezu makes two Pincer attacks and uses Pummel or Spellcasting.

      ***Pincer.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Pincer]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+5,dicelabel=Damage [Pincer]) Slashing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 15) from one of two pincers.

      ***Pummel.*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 17, one creature ***Grappled*** by the glabrezu. *Failure:* rollable(dice=3d6+5,dicelabel=Damage [Pummel]) Bludgeoning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The glabrezu casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 16):

      At will: [Darkness](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619080-darkness), [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Dispel Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619103-dispel-magic)  
      1/day each: [Confusion](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619043-confusion), [Fly](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618909-fly), [Power Word Stun](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618889-power-word-stun)  

